'''Deadly Carnival III''' (極ムズカーニバル3, ''Goku Muzukānibaru3'', '''Extreme Carnival 3''') is a special event-chapter that was added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]] and first appeared during the 40 Million Downloads Event. The first stage contains [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]]s and drops 2 [[Cat Capsule|Cat Tickets]] when cleared for the first time, while the second features enemy [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cats]] from the [[:Category:Awakening Stages|Awakening Stages]] and drops 1 Rare Cat Ticket on first completion.

